  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 811.06 Modification of a Waiver or Equivalency Determination",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 811.06 Modification of a Waiver or Equivalency Determination.\n\n(a) A modification of a waiver or equivalency determination shall be submitted to the department in accordance with Env-Wq 811.02.\n\n(b) The department shall issue a written decision on a request for a modification of a waiver or equivalency determination in accordance with Env-Wq 811.05.\n\nSource. #14571, eff 5-15-26, EXPIRES: 5-15-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wq800.html"
